            <div class="text-block lg px-3 mt-6 mt-xxl-7 zIt" data-aos="fade-in">
                <div class="block mx-auto text-center text-white">

                    <h2 class="main lh-sm">
                        Where Does Your Journey Start?
                    </h2>

                    <div class="lead-set text-secondary-color my-3">
                        <i class="fa-sharp fa-solid fa-diamond"></i>
                        <i class="fa-sharp fa-solid fa-diamond mx-2"></i>
                        <i class="fa-sharp fa-solid fa-diamond"></i>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lead f400 lh-lg">
                        The journey begins at UA Northark with an abundance of possibilities offered through a wide variety of programs. From academic disciplines to vocational training, UA Northark provides an array of options to suit diverse interests and career aspirations. To kickstart your exploration, you can take advantage of the virtual tour or witness firsthand the dynamic learning environment and sense the strong sense of community that thrives at UA Northark with an on-campus tour.<br>                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

