                                                                <div class="col-auto">
                                    <a href="https://www.northark.edu/news-and-updates/jennifer-leatherman-named-ua-northark-distinguished-alumna/" class="d-flex flex-column text-black-color link primary m-link h-100">
                                        <picture class="d-block thumb-nail lg zoom-it">
                                            <div>
