                                            </div>
                                        </picture>
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column bg-lightest-gray-color p-3 p-xxl-4 h-100">
                                            <div class="lead">
                                                <strong>Jennifer Leatherman Named UA Northark Distinguished Alumna</strong>
                                            </div>
                                                                                            <div class="text-sm fst-italic text-light-gray-color mt-1">
                                                    Posted Date - 10/07/26                                                </div>
                                                                                        <div class="text-uppercase ls1 pt-3 mt-auto">
                                                <strong>Read More</strong> <i class="fa-sharp fa-solid fa-long-arrow-right text-primary-color ms-1"></i>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </a>
                                </div>
                                                                <div class="col-auto">
                                    <a href="https://www.northark.edu/news-and-updates/petes-hog-wild-picnic-to-celebrate-university-of-arkansas-system-affiliation/" class="d-flex flex-column text-black-color link primary m-link h-100">
                                        <picture class="d-block thumb-nail lg zoom-it">
                                            <div>
                                                <img src="images/placeholder.jpg" class="hide" alt="Pete's Hog Wild Picnic to Celebrate University of Arkansas System Affiliation" />
                                            </div>
                                        </picture>
